SQL> --1] WRITE A QUERY TO DISPLAY ENAME SALARY WITH THE HIKE OF 25% AND THE EMPLOYEES WHO ARE WORKING AS ANALYST SALESMAN IN THE DEPTNO 10,20,30 ?
SQL> 
SQL> SELECT ENAME, SAL, SAL+SAL*25/100
  2  FROM EMP
  3  WHERE JOB IN ('ANALYST','SALESMAN') AND DEPTNO IN (10,20,30);

