SQL> --3] WRITE A QUERY TO DISPLAY MAXIMUM SALARY AND MINIMUM SALARY SUM OF SALARY OF THE EMPLOYEES WHO ARE WORKING IN EACH DEPARTMENT AND HAVING THE REPORTING MANAGER AND NOT GETTING COMMISSION ?
SQL> 
SQL> 
SQL> SELECT MAX(SAL), MIN(SAL), SUM(SAL), DEPTNO
  2  FROM EMP
  3  WHERE MGR IS NOT NULL AND COMM IS NULL
  4  GROUP BY DEPTNO;

