SQL> --4] WRITE A QUERY TO DISPLAY NUMBER OF EMPLOYEES AND AVERAGE SALARY OF THE EMPLOYEE WHO ARE WORKING IN EACH JOB AND HIRED IN RANGE BETWEEN 1980 AND 1990 AND WORKING IN DEPTNO 10,20,30 ?
SQL> 
SQL> 
SQL> SELECT COUNT(*), AVG(SAL) , JOB
  2  FROM EMP
  3  WHERE HIREDATE BETWEEN '01-JAN-1981' AND '31-DEC-1989' AND DEPTNO IN (10,20,30)
  4  GROUP BY JOB;

