SQL> --6]  WRITE A QUERY TO DISPLAY ENAME, SALARY OF THE EMPLOYEES AND THE EMPLOYEES WHO ARE WORKING IN THE DEPTNO 10,20,30 AND WORKING AS SALESMAN, MANAGER , ANALYST AND GETTING SALARY IN THE RANGE BETWEEN 1500 AND 5000 AND ARRANGE THE RECORDS IN DESCENDING ORDER BASED ON SALARY COLUMN ?
